   "body": "**Operator decision (2026-11-18):**\n1. **New topic: same rule.** The new-topic composer also always opens full screen, with no height toggle. Scope item 1 now covers both new MP and new topic; item 5 is answered.\n2. **Button placement in these full-screen composers:** the glass buttons (close, drafts, send) move up to **near the top of the screen**: just below the status bar / safe area, in the top bar's place, above the Destinataire/Sujet fields. They are no longer floating over the card, and are never clipped. Same size and shape as the shared composer buttons (#1126 / #1129).\n\nAcceptance adds: a hosted or snapshot check that the three buttons sit in the top band of the screen, fully visible.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
