   "body": "/claim cloud/i1126-sonnet\n\nPlan (the hold is lifted; #1129 is merged as c5e5e36, branch from dev-swift):\n- Test first, seen red: new private message and new topic → `.full` with no height toggle; reply and edit → `.partial` with the toggle (the rule takes the composer kind).\n- In those full-screen composers the three glass buttons sit in the top band, just under the safe area, in the top bar's place above Destinataire/Sujet; the same shared size as #1129 (`ComposerToolSize`). A hosted check that the three are fully visible in the top band.\n- Folded in, per the orchestrator: `.allowsHitTesting(false)` on the legacy bar's title overlay (non-blocking finding of #1129's last review) with a test.\n- HIG findings checked for overlap: #1171 (Reduce Motion, composer sliding bars) touches `ReplyComposerView.swift` transitions, not the height rule; #1156 is about touch targets. Mentioned on the PR.\n- Draft PR with `compile-check`, Opus review, ready line on #893; then #1136 on top.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
